      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am on the sdk beta 3 and am using the new quest shader, and let me say it is amazing. I have been quest converting for 6 years, and this shader changes the entire game. Before, quest materials could do one thing at a time. Color change, matcap, emission, but they couldn't do it all in one material. This new shader has matcap masks!! Actual proper hue shift!! Along with the upgraded standard lite's metallic and smoothness actually working, both with their own maps (glorious). And rim light was thrown in there too because why not. What a very rich and jampacked shader to just drop on us after quest has had such a barren landscape of shading options. \n\nThe only thing I would ask is if the rim light could be set between multiply and add, instead of just add. that is all. but the shader is already amazing so no pressure.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
